---
// Services.astro
---
<section class="section services" id="services">
	<div class="container">
		<h2 class="text-center">Our Expertise & Services</h2>
		<div class="services-grid">
			<div class="service-card">
				<div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-cpu-fill"></i></div>
				<h3>Data & AI Solutions</h3>
				<p>
					Empower your enterprise with scalable AI and advanced analytics. We deliver
					end-to-end solutions ranging from robust data engineering to model
					deployment using <strong>watsonx</strong>, ensuring ethical AI governance
					and actionable business intelligence.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="service-card">
				<div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-compass-fill"></i></div>
				<h3>Strategy Consulting</h3>
				<p>
					Future-proof your business with data-driven strategies. We provide expert
					advisory on technology roadmaps, comprehensive market analysis, and
					sustainability frameworks to drive digital transformation and tangible
					business value.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="service-card">
				<div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-cloud-check-fill"></i></div>
				<h3>Hybrid Cloud Transformation</h3>
				<p>
					Accelerate agility through seamless hybrid cloud adoption. We specialize in
					application modernization, multi-cloud orchestration, and containerization
					via <strong>OpenShift</strong> to optimize infrastructure costs and enhance
					operational resilience.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="service-card">
				<div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill"></i></div>
				<h3>Cybersecurity & Risk</h3>
				<p>
					Safeguard your critical assets with a holistic security posture. Our
					services encompass proactive threat detection, robust identity management,
					and strict regulatory compliance (GDPR, ISO) to mitigate risk and build
					digital trust.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="service-card">
				<div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-gear-wide-connected"></i></div>
				<h3>SAP Consulting</h3>
				<p>
					Maximize the potential of your ERP ecosystem. We deliver expert SAP
					S/4HANA implementation and migration, seamlessly integrating core
					enterprise systems with cloud innovations to drive intelligent workflows.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="service-card">
				<div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-laptop-fill"></i></div>
				<h3>Technology & IT Consulting</h3>
				<p>
					Architect a resilient IT foundation. We specialize in end-to-end system
					integration, complex API architecture, and the adoption of DevOps & CI/CD
					practices to streamline development cycles and accelerate time-to-market.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="service-card">
				<div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-bank2"></i></div>
				<h3>Financial Services Consulting</h3>
				<p>
					Reimagine banking and insurance for the digital age. We drive specialized
					transformation focusing on advanced risk analytics, regulatory agility, and
					hyper-personalized customer experiences for the financial sector.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="service-card">
				<div class="service-icon"><i class="bi bi-briefcase-fill"></i></div>
				<h3>Business Process Outsourcing</h3>
				<p>
					Elevate operational efficiency through strategic outsourcing. We manage
					critical functions—including HR, Finance, and Operations—with a
					consultative approach that blends human expertise with process automation.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
